# Domain {{Domain}} — Business Domain Foundation

Dokumen ini menjelaskan arsitektur, struktur internal, dan spesifikasi implementasi **Domain {{Domain}}** di MasjidCMS sesuai **Golden Domain Template (docs/DOMAIN_TEMPLATE.md)**.

---

## 1. Domain Architecture

Domain {{Domain}} dibangun secara independen di bawah namespace `{{Namespace}}`. Seluruh akses data dan logika bisnis menggunakan abstraksi **Core Platform v1.0**.

```
app/Domains/{{Domain}}/
├── Config/             # Konfigurasi domain ({{Domain}}Config)
├── Controllers/        # REST Controller ({{Entity}}Controller)
├── DTO/                # Data Transfer Objects (Create{{Entity}}DTO, Update{{Entity}}DTO)
├── Entities/           # Domain Entities ({{Entity}})
├── Models/             # CI4 Model Adapter ({{Entity}}Model)
├── Policies/           # Authorization Policies ({{Entity}}Policy)
├── Providers/          # Domain Lifecycle Provider ({{Domain}}Provider)
├── Repositories/       # Data Access Layer ({{Domain}}Repository)
├── Routes/             # Modular Routes ({{RouteSlug}}.php)
├── Services/           # Business Logic Layer ({{Domain}}Service)
└── README.md           # Domain Documentation
```

---

## 2. Dependency Diagram

```
 [ HTTP Request ]
        │
        ▼
[ {{Entity}}Controller ] ──(DTO)──► [ Create{{Entity}}DTO / Update{{Entity}}DTO ]
        │
        ▼
 [ {{Domain}}Service ] ◄──(Extends)── [ CrudService (Core) ]
    │    │    │
    │    │    ├──────► [ Validator (Core Validation Engine) ]
    │    │    ├──────► [ UnitOfWork & TransactionManager (Core) ]
    │    │    └──────► [ EventDispatcher (Generic Events) ]
    │    │
    │    ▼
[ {{Domain}}Repository ] ◄──(Extends)── [ BaseRepository (Core) ]
    │
    ▼
[ {{Entity}}Model ] ──► [ DB Table: {{Table}} ]
```

---

## 3. CRUD Flow & Request Lifecycle

```
Client Payload ──► {{Entity}}Controller ──► DTO Parsing
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                   {{Domain}}Service::create(data)
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                    validateCreate() [BEFORE Tx]
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                     TransactionManager::begin()
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                     {{Domain}}Repository::create()
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                     TransactionManager::commit()
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                     EntityCreatedEvent dispatched
                                               │
                                               ▼
                                     ResponseFormatter (HTTP 201)
```

---

## 4. Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET` | `/{{RouteSlug}}` | Mengambil daftar {{Domain}} (terpaginasi) |
| `GET` | `/{{RouteSlug}}/{id}` | Mengambil detail {{Entity}} |
| `POST` | `/{{RouteSlug}}` | Membuat {{Entity}} baru |
| `PUT` | `/{{RouteSlug}}/{id}` | Memperbarui {{Entity}} |
| `DELETE` | `/{{RouteSlug}}/{id}` | Menghapus {{Entity}} (Soft Delete) |
